  "evidence": "TEXT_C: Protect the Human Rights Act and ECHR; oppose mass surveillance; EU: oppose withdrawal and require a double‑majority; strong climate targets, moratorium on fracking, expand renewables; appoint an LGBT+ rights envoy; oppose Trident renewal; democratic reforms like STV, abolish House of Lords, votes at 16. TEXT_E: Target net migration in the tens of thousands with tougher deportation/enforcement; replace the Human Rights Act with a British Bill of Rights and update communications data laws; counter‑extremism banning/disruption orders; hold an in/out EU referendum with a sovereignty emphasis; maintain strong Armed Forces and retain Trident; tougher sentences and police/prison reforms; support shale and end new onshore wind subsidies.",
